# head/adult/earrings: gilt earrings: a ring under each ear lobe (in metal 2), the lit one brighter
# P2b FACES (wave 2). Over the hair (ears layer) so they read through long hair. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult youth
role earring earrings
layer ears
anchor head
keys rest
z 1

view D key rest origin -1 -11
|P............N
|O............N

view U key rest origin -1 -11
|P............N
|O............N

view R key rest origin -7 -12
|P
|O

view L key rest origin -8 -12
|P
|N
